      48.01,
      278.61,
      419.93,
      304.07
    ],
    "reading_order": 8,
    "text": "We shall now look at some examples and theorems and analyse their proofs to\nhelp us in getting a better understanding of how they are constructed.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
