    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      309.1,
      420.08,
      360.95
    ],
    "reading_order": 9,
    "text": "We begin by using the so-called ‘direct’ or ‘deductive’ method of proof. In this\nmethod, we make several statements. Each is based on previous statements. If\neach statement is logically correct (i.e., a valid argument), it leads to a logically correct\nconclusion.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
